@startuml
title OIDC Login Flow (Authorization Code + PKCE)

actor User
participant "   Browser    \nLaptop" as Browser
participant "   BlazorSSR  \nClient" as Client
participant "OIDC Middleware\nClient" as Middleware
participant "Identity&Access\nServer" as IdP
participant "Banking API\nREST API" as API

User -> Browser : Open protected page
Browser -> Client : GET /
Client -> Middleware : Not authenticated
Middleware -> Browser : Redirect to /identity/login

Browser -> Client : GET /identity/login
Client -> Middleware : Challenge()

Middleware -> Middleware : create state, nonce,\ncode_verifier + code_challenge
Middleware -> Browser : Redirect to IdP /connect/authorize
Browser -> IdP : /connect/authorize\nresponse_type=code\nscope=openid profile\nstate, nonce, code_challenge

IdP -> User : Login page
User -> IdP : Enter credentials

IdP -> Browser : Redirect to /signin-oidc?code=...
Browser -> Client : GET /signin-oidc?code=...
Client -> Middleware : Process callback

Middleware -> IdP : /connect/token\ngrant_type=authorization_code\ncode + code_verifier
IdP -> Middleware : id_token + access_token

Middleware -> Middleware : validate tokens\ncreate ClaimsPrincipal
Middleware -> Browser : Auth cookie created

User -> Browser : Open /dispatcher
Browser -> Client : GET /dispatcher
Client -> API : GET /customers/me/profile\nBearer access_token
API -> Client : 200 OK
Client -> Browser : Render page

@enduml